name edichokey
category Package
revision 56223
shortdesc Typeset dichotomous identification keys
longdesc This is a LaTeX package for typesetting dichotomous
longdesc identification key in indented style. It can be considered as
longdesc an extended version of package dichokey, as edichokey is more
longdesc capable of dealing with complex keys.
